    "According to you, how can LLMs be used to innovate math learning in schools and universities?": "LLMs can personalize math learning by adapting to individual student needs, like explaining concepts in simple language or generating practice problems tailored to their level. They can also provide instant feedback, making math practice more engaging and less intimidating for students who struggle with traditional methods."
